Always-On Service (launchd)
-----------------------------
The backend runs as a macOS launchd service — starts on login, restarts on crash.

Plist:   ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.signaltrade.backend.plist
Logs:    ~/TradingRecommendationSystem/backend/logs/server.log
App:     http://localhost:8000

Commands:
  launchctl list | grep signaltrade                        # check status
  tail -f ~/TradingRecommendationSystem/backend/logs/server.log  # live logs
  launchctl unload ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.signaltrade.backend.plist  # stop
  launchctl load   ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.signaltrade.backend.plist  # start
  lsof -ti :8000 | xargs kill -9                          # force-kill stale port


