Signal Engine Logic (signal_engine.py)
----------------------------------------
Every 60 seconds, for each ticker, 28+ signal sources contribute to a composite score:

Score = 0
─── Oscillators ──────────────────────────────────────
+ RSI oversold/overbought                (±25)
+ Stochastic %K/%D cross + zone          (±15 cross / ±8 zone)
+ Williams %R oversold/overbought        (±10)
+ CCI extreme deviation                  (±10 / ±5 moderate)
─── Momentum / Trend ─────────────────────────────────
+ MACD crossover / histogram expansion   (±22 / ±10)
+ EMA 8/21 crossover / alignment         (±12 cross / ±5 align)
+ Price vs SMA 50 / 200                  (±15 + ±8)
+ Golden Cross / Death Cross             (±12)
─── Volume ───────────────────────────────────────────
+ OBV trend + slope confirmation         (±10 / ±4)
+ High volume confirmation               (±8)
─── Structure ────────────────────────────────────────
+ ADX trend strength (>25 = amplify)     (±8)
+ Bollinger Band touch                   (±10)
+ 52-Week High/Low proximity             (+10 breakout / +8 deep value)
+ Candlestick pattern                    (±12 reversal / ±5 doji)
+ Pivot S1/R1 level                      (±8)
─── Alternative / Fundamental ───────────────────────
+ Finnhub news sentiment                 (±20)
+ SEC EDGAR insider net flow             (±15)
+ Short interest / squeeze setup         (±10 squeeze / ±5 bearish)
+ Analyst target revision momentum       (±8)
+ Congressional trading (Quiverquant)    (±8)
+ Google Trends retail search surge      (±6)
─── Options ──────────────────────────────────────────
+ P/C ratio, sweeps, OTM activity        (±12)
+ IV rank, 25d skew                      (±5)
+ Gamma Exposure (GEX)                   (±3)
─── Market-Wide Context ──────────────────────────────
+ Fear & Greed (contrarian)              (±15)
+ Relative Strength vs S&P 500 (1M)     (±12)
+ Macro: VIX, yield curve, HYG, DXY     (±20)
+ Sector rotation cycle stage            (±6)
+ AAII sentiment (contrarian)            (±8)
+ COT positioning                        (±8)
+ 13F institutional flow                 (±10)
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Confidence = 35% + |score| × 0.40   (max 100%)
Action     = BUY (score > 22) / SELL (score < -22) / HOLD
Style      = intraday (RSI dominant) / swing (MACD) / position (SMA)
Entry      = current price
Stop       = entry ± 2×ATR
Target     = entry ± 3×ATR  →  R:R ≈ 1.5


WhatsApp Auto-Send (scanner.py)
---------------------------------
New BUY/SELL signals are automatically sent to WhatsApp when confidence ≥ threshold.
HOLD signals and refreshed (duplicate) signals are never auto-sent.

Config in .env:
  AUTO_SEND_WHATSAPP=true
  WHATSAPP_MIN_CONFIDENCE=70     # raise to reduce noise, lower to catch more signals

Flow:
  scan → new signal found → confidence ≥ 70%? → send via Twilio → log to DB
                                              ↓ no
                                         log as skipped

Twilio sandbox setup (one-time):
  FROM: whatsapp:+14155238886    (Twilio sandbox number)
  TO:   whatsapp:+<your number>  (must have texted "join <keyword>" to sandbox first)


